[00:00.000] 作词 : Cassie Wei
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Cassie Wei/Yamato Kasai
[00:16.770]Sleep for a total of 800 hours per day
[00:20.206]And then drink a liter of milk, warm up before you go play
[00:24.253]Only eat, or write, or pull the trigger with your right hand
[00:28.306]Only thing that’s left is to work on following commands
[00:32.352]By the time you realize, you’ll be restrained to a desk
[00:36.081]And with your dreams on the floor you comply, eyes chained to the test
[00:40.074]In 30 minutes find a groom or bride, bonus if brunette
[00:44.196]In 90 hours spill their insides, paint your room picturesque
[00:49.399]Now it’s time for another vendetta
[00:56.030]Going through the shelves, picking out my prewritten persona
[01:03.550]Children of the city sees only the neon stars
[01:10.779]Reflected upon the murky gutter sky
[01:14.840]Don’t ask me why I desperately wish to be included in the city’s night
[01:31.584]In 400,000 meters, turn right
[01:37.401]Pick up a knife and stab a familiar warm body
[01:41.266]Learned to fight before I knew love or bitterness of coffee
[01:45.352]Snippy scissors cut down the strings, I set myself free
[01:49.459]Only to figure out everything I chose was by proxy
[01:53.604]As we suckled upon the 9mm pacifier
[01:57.452]Swallowing the fact that other than to expand we had no purpose
[02:01.824]As my everburning will to stay afloat backfires
[02:05.790]I now know I must be comfortable being who I considered worthless
[02:10.113]Follow the city’s ribbon
[02:13.810]To a heart nobody seems to listen
[02:18.372]It takes my heart being broken and broken again
[02:22.372]To know that I am the reason why the sufferings never end
[02:26.363]Now it’s time for another vendetta
[02:32.699]Going through the shelves, picking out my prewritten persona
[02:40.415]Children of the city sees only the neon stars
[02:47.614]Reflected upon the murky gutter sky
[02:51.670]Don’t ask me why I desperately wish to be noticed by the city’s eyes
[03:08.064]Do not go home until you finish reading the value of e
[03:14.006]2.71 8281 8284 5904 5235 3602 8747 1352 6624 9775 7247 0936 9995 9574 9669 6762…